
DATASET ACTIVATE DatenSet1.
GLM R_QUIET R_DISSIMILAR R_SIMILAR BY TASK
  /WSFACTOR=Sound 3 Polynomial 
  /METHOD=SSTYPE(3)
  /EMMEANS=TABLES(OVERALL) 
  /EMMEANS=TABLES(TASK) 
  /EMMEANS=TABLES(Sound) 
  /EMMEANS=TABLES(TASK*Sound) 
  /PRINT=DESCRIPTIVE ETASQ 
  /CRITERIA=ALPHA(.05)
  /WSDESIGN=Sound 
  /DESIGN=TASK.

GLM RI_QUIET RI_DISSIMILAR RI_SIMILAR UI_QUIET UI_DISSIMILAR UI_SIMILAR BY TASK
  /WSFACTOR=IntrusionType 2 Polynomial Sound 3 Polynomial 
  /METHOD=SSTYPE(3)
  /EMMEANS=TABLES(OVERALL) 
  /EMMEANS=TABLES(TASK) 
  /EMMEANS=TABLES(Sound) 
  /EMMEANS=TABLES(TASK*Sound) 
  /PRINT=DESCRIPTIVE ETASQ 
  /CRITERIA=ALPHA(.05)
  /WSDESIGN=IntrusionType Sound IntrusionType*Sound
  /DESIGN=TASK.

SORT CASES  BY TASK.
SPLIT FILE SEPARATE BY TASK.

T-TEST PAIRS=R_DISSIMILAR WITH R_SIMILAR (PAIRED)
  /CRITERIA=CI(.9500)
  /MISSING=ANALYSIS.

GLM RI_QUIET RI_DISSIMILAR RI_SIMILAR UI_QUIET UI_DISSIMILAR UI_SIMILAR
  /WSFACTOR=IntrusionType 2 Polynomial Sound 3 Polynomial 
  /METHOD=SSTYPE(3)
  /EMMEANS=TABLES(OVERALL) 
  /EMMEANS=TABLES(Sound) 
  /PRINT=DESCRIPTIVE ETASQ 
  /CRITERIA=ALPHA(.05)
  /WSDESIGN=IntrusionType Sound IntrusionType*Sound.
